  <entry>
    <title>report02</title>
    <link href="/2026/11/01/report02/"/>
    <url>/2026/11/01/report02/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="web">web</h1><h2 id="JavaScript入门">JavaScript入门</h2><p>1、</p><figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs js">&lt;button onclick=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;alert(&#x27;欢迎&#x27;)&quot;</span>&gt;按钮&lt;/button&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注：alert函数用来弹出对话框显示信息，onclick事件会在元素被点击时发生。<br>2、</p><figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs js">&lt;script&gt;<br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">document</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">write</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;第一个JavaScript程序&quot;</span>)<br>&lt;/script&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>3、代码从上往下执行<br>4、标识符</p><figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs js">&lt;script&gt;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> str1=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;欢迎来到JavaScript&quot;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">document</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">write</span>(str1)<br>&lt;/script&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注：var声明变量，函数作用域，存在变量提升，可重复声明，无块级作用域<br>5、JavaScript通过 // 或 /*      */  进行注释<br>6、定义与赋值</p><figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs js">&lt;script&gt;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> name =<span class="hljs-string">&quot;L&quot;</span>;  <span class="hljs-comment">//let声明的变量只在其所在的代码块有效(类似于局部变量)，且不可重复声明同名变量</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-variable constant_">PI</span> =<span class="hljs-string">&quot;3.1415&quot;</span>;  <span class="hljs-comment">//与let相同但其定义的变量一旦定义不可修改</span><br>&lt;/script&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>7、数据类型：字符串，数字，布尔，空，未定义，Symbol，对象，数组，函数<br>‘’'js</p><script>    var a = 100;    var b = "10086";    var c = true;    var d = false;    var e;</script><figure class="highlight gml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs gml"><span class="hljs-number">8</span>、操作符<br>```js<br>&lt;<span class="hljs-variable language_">script</span>&gt;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">x</span> =<span class="hljs-number">100</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">typeof</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">x</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">//获取变量x的数据类型</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">typeof</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">x</span>); <span class="hljs-comment">//获取变量x的数据类型</span><br>    documet.write(<span class="hljs-built_in">typeof</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">x</span>)<br>&lt;/<span class="hljs-variable language_">script</span>&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>9、Symbol类型</p><figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs js">&lt;script&gt;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> str = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;123&quot;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> sym1 = <span class="hljs-title class_">Symbol</span>(str);<br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(sym1); <span class="hljs-comment">//输出Symbol(123)</span><br>&lt;/script&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="docker的认识">Docker的认识</h1><p>1、Docker概述<br>2、Docker安装<br>3、Docker命令<br>1镜像命令<br>2容器命令<br>3操作命令<br>…<br>4、Docker镜像<br>5、容器数据卷<br>6、DockerFile<br>7、Docker网络原理<br>8、IDEA整合Docker</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
